Package: soluna
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libasound2 (>= 1.1)
Description: Open Network Audio System
 Soluna is an open-source network audio system providing low-latency
 audio streaming over Ethernet, WiFi, and WAN. Features include planet-scale
 3-tier cascade relay, P2P swarm distribution for up to 3 billion listeners,
 copyright detection with tiered royalty billing, built-in wallet system,
 and DSP plugin support.
 .
 This package contains the solunad daemon and solctl CLI tool.
